#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:12
msgid ""
"dekimasen.app tracks deadlines for Japanese events and sends you a\n"
"    Discord DM before the ones you care about close. To do that it has to"
"\n"
"    store a small amount of information about you. This page says exactly"
"\n"
"    what, why, and for how long, in plain language. The rules for using "
"the\n"
"    service itself are on a separate page — see the\n"
"    <a href=\"/terms\">terms of service</a>."
msgstr ""
"dekimasen.app 会追踪日本活动的截止时间，并在你关注的事项截止前通过 Discord 给你发送 "
"DM。为此，我们需要存储少量与你有关的信息。本页会用通俗易懂的语言明确说明存储哪些信息、为何存储，以及保留多久。服务本身的使用规则另见<a "
"href=\"/terms\">服务条款</a>。"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:20
msgid "What we collect"
msgstr "我们收集的信息"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:23
msgid ""
"<strong>Your basic Discord account info</strong> — your Discord user ID, "
"display name, and avatar ID. We only ask Discord for basic profile access"
" (<code>identify</code>)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Discord 账号的基本信息</strong> — Discord 用户 ID、显示名称和头像 ID。我们只会向 Discord"
" 请求基本资料访问权限（<code>identify</code>）。"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:26
msgid ""
"<strong>Your timezone</strong> — either the one you picked, or the one\n"
"      your browser reported, so deadlines show in your local time "
"alongside\n"
"      JST."
msgstr "<strong>你的时区</strong> — 你选择的时区，或浏览器报告的时区，以便在 JST 旁同时显示你的当地时间。"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:31
msgid ""
"<strong>Your reminder settings</strong> — the reminder rules you\n"
"      create, your reminder presets, the tags you subscribe to, and any\n"
"      lottery outcomes you record (applied, won, lost, paid), which the "
"app\n"
"      uses to stop reminding you about rounds you are done with."
msgstr ""
"<strong>你的提醒设置</strong> — "
"你创建的提醒规则、提醒预设、订阅的标签，以及记录的抽选结果（已申请、中签、落选、已付款）。应用会据此停止提醒你已经处理完的轮次。"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:37
msgid ""
"<strong>Pending and sent reminders</strong> — the queue of reminders\n"
"      scheduled for you, and whether each has been delivered."
msgstr "<strong>待发送和已发送的提醒</strong> — 为你排定的提醒队列，以及每条提醒是否已送达。"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:41
msgid ""
"<strong>Login sessions</strong> — a random session token per login.\n"
"      Only its SHA-256 hash is stored, never the token itself."
msgstr "<strong>登录会话</strong> — 每次登录使用一个随机会话令牌。我们只存储其 SHA-256 哈希，绝不存储令牌本身。"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:45
msgid ""
"<strong>Your calendar feed link</strong>, if you create one. We store "
"only a SHA-256 hash. Anyone with the link can see your upcoming "
"deadlines, so keep it private like a password. If you lose it or want to "
"turn it off, create a new link. The old link will stop working."
msgstr ""
"<strong>日历订阅链接</strong>（如果你创建了一个）：我们只会保存它的 SHA-256 "
"哈希。任何拿到链接的人都能查看你接下来的截止时间，因此请像保护密码一样保管好它。如果链接丢失或不想再使用，请创建一个新链接，旧链接会停止使用。"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:48
msgid ""
"<strong>Whether Discord can send you DMs</strong> — we save one setting "
"when a DM fails so we can explain why reminders stopped."
msgstr "<strong>Discord 能否向你发送 DM</strong> — 当 DM 发送失败时，我们会保存一项设置，以便说明提醒停止的原因。"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:51
msgid ""
"<strong>What you contributed</strong> — if you have editor rights,\n"
"      the events, tags, and edits you made are recorded with you as the\n"
"      author."
msgstr "<strong>你贡献的内容</strong> — 如果你拥有编辑权限，你创建的活动、标签以及所作的编辑都会记录你为作者。"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:57
msgid "What we do not collect"
msgstr "我们不收集的信息"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:59
msgid "No email address. Discord login never hands us one."
msgstr "我们不收集电子邮箱地址。通过 Discord 登录也不会向我们提供邮箱地址。"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:60
msgid "No IP addresses in the database."
msgstr "数据库中不存储 IP 地址。"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:62
msgid ""
"The bot does not collect message content. It does not have permission to "
"read your messages, server list, or friends."
msgstr "机器人不会收集消息内容，也没有权限读取你的消息、服务器列表或好友列表。"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:64
msgid "No analytics, no third-party trackers, no advertising."
msgstr "不使用分析工具、第三方跟踪器或广告。"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:67
msgid "Why we collect it"
msgstr "我们为何收集这些信息"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:69
msgid ""
"We use this information only to send the event deadline reminders you "
"asked for and show you your settings. We do not use it for anything else."
" We do not use it to build a profile, rate you, or make automated "
"decisions about you."
msgstr "我们只会用这些信息发送你设置的活动截止提醒，并显示你的设置，不会用于其他用途。我们不会用这些信息建立用户画像、给你评分或对你作出自动决定。"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:72
msgid "Sharing"
msgstr "信息共享"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:74
msgid ""
"We do not share your data. We do not sell, rent, or give it to other "
"companies. We only send the information needed to Discord to deliver your"
" DM."
msgstr "我们不会共享你的数据，也不会出售、出租或提供给其他公司。只会向 Discord 发送投递 DM 所需的信息。"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:77
msgid "How long we keep it"
msgstr "我们保留多久"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:79
msgid ""
"We keep your data while your account is active. We back up the database "
"every night in private, encrypted storage. Backups are deleted "
"automatically after 30 days. When you delete your account, your data is "
"removed from the live site right away, but it may remain in backups for "
"up to 30 days."
msgstr ""
"账户有效期间，我们会保存你的数据。数据库每晚都会备份到私有且加密的存储空间。备份会在 30 "
"天后自动删除。删除账户后，你的数据会立即从网站中删除，但最多还会在备份中保留 30 天。"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:82
msgid "Cookies"
msgstr "Cookie"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:84
msgid ""
"We use one cookie to keep you signed in. We do not use analytics or "
"tracking cookies, so there is no cookie consent banner."
msgstr "我们只使用一个 Cookie 来保持登录状态，不使用分析或跟踪 Cookie，因此不会显示 Cookie 同意横幅。"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:87
msgid "Your rights"
msgstr "你的权利"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:89
msgid ""
"You can ask for a copy of your data, ask for it to be corrected, or ask\n"
"    for it to be deleted. Just get in touch:"
msgstr "你可以申请获取数据副本、更正数据或删除数据。请通过以下方式联系我们："

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:94 src/app/web/templates/terms.html:89
#, python-format
msgid "Discord: %(contact_discord)s"
msgstr "Discord：%(contact_discord)s"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:97 src/app/web/templates/terms.html:92
msgid "Email:"
msgstr "电子邮箱："

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:108 src/app/web/templates/terms.html:103
msgid ""
"This deployment has not published contact details yet. If you reached\n"
"    this page from a running site, contact whoever operates it."
msgstr "此部署尚未公布联系方式。如果你是在实际运行的网站上看到本页，请联系网站运营者。"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:113
msgid ""
"Deleting your account removes your personal data, including your login "
"sessions, reminders, presets, tag subscriptions, and lottery results. "
"Events, tags, and edit history you added stay in the shared catalogue, "
"but your name is removed. This keeps events available for other people "
"who follow them."
msgstr "删除账户后，你的登录会话、提醒、预设、标签关注和抽选结果等个人数据都会被删除。你添加的活动、标签和编辑记录会保留在共享目录中，但你的名字会被移除，以便其他人继续查看其关注的活动。"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:116
msgid "Changes to this policy"
msgstr "本政策的变更"

#: src/app/web/templates/privacy.html:118
msgid ""
"If this policy changes, the date at the top of this page changes with\n"
"    it. There is no mailing list to notify, since we do not have your "
"email\n"
"    address."
msgstr "如果本政策发生变更，本页顶部的日期也会随之更改。由于我们没有你的电子邮箱地址，不会通过邮件列表通知。"

#: src/app/web/templates/retroactive_apply.html:2
msgid "confirm"
msgstr "确认"

