msgid "A franchise is the top level. It contains groups."
msgstr "系列是最高层级，其中包含组合。"

#: src/app/web/templates/tags.html:307
msgid "A single performer. Can belong to a group, or stand alone."
msgstr "一位出演者，可以属于某个组合，也可以独立活动。"

#: src/app/web/templates/tags.html:308
msgid "A place. Discover filters venues by region, not individually."
msgstr "一个地点。发现页只能按地区筛选场馆，不能逐个筛选。"

#: src/app/web/templates/tags.html:310
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A {kind} tag with this name is already used by {concerts} and followed by"
" {followers}. Creating another one will keep them separate because tags "
"cannot be merged yet."
msgstr "同名的 {kind} 标签已用于 {concerts}，并由 {followers} 关注。再创建一个会使两者保持分开，因为目前无法合并标签。"

#: src/app/web/templates/tags.html:313
msgid "follower"
msgstr "关注者"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:12
msgid ""
"These are the terms for using dekimasen.app. By signing in you agree to\n"
"    them. They are short on purpose: this is a free hobby project, not a\n"
"    company, and the honest version fits on one page. How your data is\n"
"    handled is a separate page — see the\n"
"    <a href=\"/privacy\">privacy policy</a>."
msgstr ""
"这些是使用 dekimasen.app "
"的条款。登录即表示你同意这些条款。我们特意将其写得很短：这是一个免费的个人项目，而不是公司，如实版本一页就够了。你的数据如何处理另见 <a "
"href=\"/privacy\">隐私政策</a>。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:19
msgid "What this is"
msgstr "本服务是什么"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:21
msgid ""
"dekimasen.app tracks deadlines for Japanese events — lottery rounds, "
"serial-code sales, and stream tickets — and sends you a Discord DM before"
" the ones you follow close. One person runs it for free, so it may not "
"always work perfectly. The service is independent from Discord, artists, "
"agencies, venues, promoters, and ticket sellers. They do not run or "
"officially support it. Names and events belong to their owners; this site"
" only lists deadlines."
msgstr ""
"dekimasen.app 会追踪日本活动的截止时间——包括抽选轮次、抽选码商品发售和直播票——并在你关注的事项截止前通过 Discord 发送 "
"DM。该服务由个人免费运营，因此可能无法始终保持正常运行。它独立于 "
"Discord、艺人、经纪公司、场馆、主办方和票务平台，这些机构不会运营或官方支持本服务。名称和活动归其所有者所有；本站只列出截止时间。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:24
msgid "Who can use it"
msgstr "谁可以使用"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:26
msgid ""
"You need a Discord account to sign in. You must also be old enough to use"
" Discord in your country. Discord's terms still apply."
msgstr "你需要 Discord 账号才能登录，也必须达到所在国家或地区使用 Discord 的最低年龄。Discord 的条款仍然适用。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:29
msgid "No guarantees"
msgstr "不作任何保证"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:31
msgid ""
"This service comes with no guarantees. Reminders may be late, may not "
"arrive, or may show an incorrect deadline."
msgstr "本服务不作保证。提醒可能延迟、无法送达，或显示错误的截止时间。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:34
msgid ""
"These problems can happen. Discord may block or delay a DM. The server "
"may be down or miss a reminder. An editor may enter the wrong date, or an"
" organizer may change it. Always check the official source before relying"
" on a deadline shown here."
msgstr ""
"这些问题都可能发生。Discord 可能会阻止或延迟 "
"DM，服务器也可能停止运行或漏发提醒。编辑者可能填错日期，主办方也可能更改日期。依赖这里显示的截止时间前，请务必查看官方来源。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:37
msgid "Limitation of liability"
msgstr "责任限制"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:39
msgid ""
"Where the law allows, the operator is not responsible for losses caused "
"by using the service, such as a missed deadline, missed lottery, or "
"missed ticket. This is a free service and comes with no guarantees."
msgstr "在法律允许的范围内，运营者不对使用本服务造成的损失负责，例如错过截止时间、错过抽选或未能获得门票。本服务免费提供，不作保证。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:42
msgid "Acceptable use"
msgstr "可接受的使用方式"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:44
msgid "Do not use bots to copy data from the site or send automatic requests."
msgstr "请勿使用机器人复制网站数据或发送自动请求。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:46
msgid ""
"Do not attempt to break it, disrupt it, or reach data or accounts that\n"
"      are not yours."
msgstr "不要试图破坏或干扰服务，也不要访问不属于你的数据或账户。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:50
msgid ""
"If you have editor rights, use them in good faith: add real events,\n"
"      keep entries accurate, and do not vandalise or spam the catalogue."
msgstr "如果你拥有编辑权限，请善意使用：只添加真实活动，保持条目准确，不要破坏目录或发布垃圾内容。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:55
msgid "Editor contributions"
msgstr "编辑者贡献的内容"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:57
msgid ""
"Events, tags, and edits made by an editor go into a shared catalogue\n"
"    that everyone on the site uses. That content stays even if you stop\n"
"    using the service or ask for your account to be deleted — only your\n"
"    name is removed from it, so the events other people are following do\n"
"    not disappear because one person left. By contributing you agree to\n"
"    that arrangement. The\n"
"    <a href=\"/privacy\">privacy policy</a> says the same thing from the "
"data\n"
"    side."
msgstr ""
"编辑者创建的活动、标签和编辑记录会进入网站所有用户共用的目录。即使你停止使用服务或要求删除账户，这些内容仍会保留 — "
"只会移除你的姓名，以免你离开后其他人关注的活动也随之消失。提交内容即表示你同意这一安排。<a "
"href=\"/privacy\">隐私政策</a>从数据处理角度说明了同一事项。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:67
msgid "Availability and shutdown"
msgstr "服务可用性与关停"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:69
msgid ""
"The service may change, stop working, or shut down at any time. We may "
"block access for anyone who misuses it or breaks these terms. You can "
"stop using it at any time."
msgstr "本服务可能随时更改、停止运行或关闭。对于滥用服务或违反这些条款的用户，我们可能会阻止其访问。你可以随时停止使用。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:72
msgid "Changes to these terms"
msgstr "这些条款的变更"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:74
msgid ""
"If these terms change, the date at the top of this page changes with\n"
"    them. Continuing to use the service after that means you accept the "
"new\n"
"    version."
msgstr "如果这些条款发生变更，本页顶部的日期也会随之更改。此后继续使用本服务即表示你接受新版本。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:79
msgid "Governing law"
msgstr "适用法律"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:81
msgid ""
"These terms are governed by the laws of the Province of New Brunswick\n"
"    and the federal laws of Canada applicable therein."
msgstr "这些条款受新不伦瑞克省法律及适用于该省的加拿大联邦法律管辖。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:85
msgid "Contact"
msgstr "联系方式"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:86
msgid "Questions about any of this:"
msgstr "如对以上内容有任何疑问："

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:108
msgid ""
"In short: this is a reminder tool made by a fan, not a ticket seller. "
"Check the official page before every deadline."
msgstr "简而言之：这是由粉丝制作的提醒工具，并非票务销售方。每个截止时间前都请查看官方页面。"

