#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:347
msgid "Confirm your timezone"
msgstr "确认你的时区"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:348
msgid ""
"Deadlines always show JST first, then this timezone — so you never have "
"to convert a\n"
"    23:59 JST close in your head."
msgstr "截止时间始终先显示 JST，再显示此时区的时间 — 这样，你就不用在脑中换算 23:59 JST 对应几点。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:352
#, python-format
msgid "Detected <strong>%(tz)s</strong>"
msgstr "已检测到 <strong>%(tz)s</strong>"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:353
msgid "(auto-detected from your browser)"
msgstr "（从你的浏览器自动检测）"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:373
msgid "Use this timezone"
msgstr "使用此时区"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:421
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Right now that reads\n"
"  <span class=\"num\">%(tz_preview)s</span> for you."
msgstr ""
"你当前看到的时间是\n"
"  <span class=\"num\">%(tz_preview)s</span>。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:426
msgid "Looks right, continue"
msgstr "看起来没错，继续"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:434
msgid ""
"Send a test DM now to check that Discord reminders work. If your DMs are "
"blocked, we'll tell you here."
msgstr "现在发送测试 DM，确认 Discord 提醒能否正常送达。如果 DM 被阻止，我们会在这里告诉你。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:439
msgid "Send test DM"
msgstr "发送测试 DM"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:448
msgid ""
"✅ <b>Test reminder.</b> If you can read this, test DMs are working. "
"Deadline reminders will look like this and show both JST and your time "
"zone."
msgstr "✅ <b>测试提醒。</b>如果你能看到这条消息，测试 DM 可以正常送达。截止提醒也会采用这种格式，同时显示 JST 和你的时区时间。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:453
msgid ""
"The Discord bot isn't running in this environment\n"
"  (dev mode), so DMs can't be tested here."
msgstr ""
"此环境中未运行 Discord 机器人\n"
"  （开发模式），因此无法在这里测试 DM。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:466
msgid "Get your calendar feed"
msgstr "获取你的日历订阅"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:467
msgid ""
"Add this feed to your phone or calendar app to keep your reminder "
"deadlines updated. It gives you a backup to Discord DMs."
msgstr "将此订阅添加到手机或日历应用后，你设置提醒的截止时间会自动更新。它也可以作为 Discord DM 的备用方式。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:472
msgid "✓ Your feed link is ready — save it now, it won't be shown again."
msgstr "✓ 订阅链接已就绪 — 请立即保存，它不会再次显示。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:477
msgid "Add it in Google Calendar, Apple Calendar, or Outlook."
msgstr "请在 Google 日历、Apple 日历或 Outlook 中添加。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:481
msgid "Your feed is active."
msgstr "你的订阅已启用。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:491
msgid "You're ready. Next, choose which events you plan to attend."
msgstr "准备完成。接下来，请选择你计划参加的活动。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:492
msgid "Continue to my events"
msgstr "前往我的活动"

